5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Hi everyone! I'm excited to help. I want to make sure we can actually finish the work on time. What do you all think we should check first?,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,A pleasure to be here. I suspect the most elegant plan on paper often clashes with the stubborn reality of the soil and the citizens. I'll be looking for practical data.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,Hello... I just wonder who will take care of the flowers and the grass every day after it's finished. I want to know who does the work.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,It is a pleasure. I believe we should prioritize the long-term durability of the work. Drawings can be misleading; we need to see how previous projects have actually aged.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,Hello. I agree with the need for practicality. I am particularly interested in the long-term financial burden of maintenance once the project is complete.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, that's a good point! I'm worried about the diggers and the firms. I'll check on the local companies and the site hoarding notes.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, a prudent choice. I shall investigate the drainage and heat readings, as well as the weekday crossing counts. The ground and the people must be understood.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,I think I will look at the groundskeeping roll and the volunteer groups. I want to see if there are kind people helping.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,I will examine the condition of works from the earlier programme and the record of the eastern avenue planting. We must see the reality of the last decade.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I will look into the upkeep ledger spend per hectare and the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services. I want to see where the money goes.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
